      "section": "main",
      "statement": "In every dimension n ≥ 2, a uniformly convex C² objective with a globally one-half Hölder Hessian admits a classical DFP sequence satisfying the paper's strong Wolfe parameter range whose gradient norms tend to a positive limit.",
      "statementDependencies": [],
      "title": "DFP can fail under strong Wolfe conditions",
      "type": "Theorem",
      "paperMapping": "Main result, strengthened by the sharpness statement proved later in the paper.",
