      "section": "main",
      "statement": "An affine coordinate change gives identity initialization, preserves strong Wolfe conditions and one-half Hölder Hessian regularity, and keeps the gradient norms bounded away from zero. The uniform Hessian bounds depend on the coordinate change.",
